Facts from other works
----------------------

Shelly's API documentation (shelly-api-docs.shelly.cloud: the Gen1 HTTP
API, CoIoT and MQTT; the Gen2+ RPC API, its components, authentication,
the WebSocket and MQTT channels, the outbound WebSocket, BLE RPC). IETF
RFC 7252 (CoAP framing), RFC 7616 (HTTP digest with SHA-256) and RFC
6763 (DNS-SD, package discover). Facts only; no documentation text is
reproduced. A few behaviours of the RPC API (script code read in pages
by byte offset, script support decided from Shelly.ListMethods) were
read from aioshelly's source (Apache-2.0); no code was taken.

Package bthome follows the BTHome format as published at bthome.io (the
object table, flags and encryption layout; its two worked examples are
test vectors) and RFC 3610 (AES-CCM; packet vector #1 is a test vector).
The object table was checked against bthome-ble 3.24.0 (MIT, Copyright
(c) 2022 Ernst Klamer); the "ble.scan_result" event forms and Shelly
manufacturer data blocks were read from aioshelly 13.34.1. Facts only; no
code or text was taken. BTHome is an open format; this module is not
affiliated with the BTHome project.

